# E12 NumberGame: sequential, fixed order, numbers drawn by a static Random seeded as the oracle and written with
# two decimals (F2), so the C# fixes the order of every line (exact trace, level (a)). Each turn, each agent says the
# agents whose number is within 10 of its own, then draws another.
cover all
fact order ^(I am|\w+ with number|My number is now|-{46}$)
fact saw ^I am (\w+)\. My number is ([\d.]+) and I saw:$
fact nothing ^I am (\w+)\. I did't see anything interesting\.$
fact seen ^(\w+) with number = ([\d.]+)$
fact now ^My number is now ([\d.]+)$
fact separator ^-{46}$
same order seq
same saw seq
same nothing seq
same seen seq
same now seq
same separator count
# three agents act in each of the 9 turns after the setup turn
check now count == 27
fact error (Exception|out of range)
optional error
check error count == 0
